OL,3,AFridges in French supermarkets hit by
OL,4,Acyber attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of French supermarkets have
OL,7,Fbeen hit by a cyber attack that caused
OL,8,Ftheir fridges and freezers to heat up,
OL,9,Fspoiling fresh and frozen food
OL,10,Festimated to be worth millions of
OL,11,Feuros.
OL,13,FHackers gained control of the software
OL,14,Fthat regulates the temperatures of the
OL,15,Frefrigeration units, forcing some to
OL,16,Fwarm to 50C (120F) overnight, according
OL,17,Fto one supermarket chain affected.
OL,19,FThe chief executive of Cooperative U
OL,20,Fsaid several of its supermarkets had
OL,21,Fbeen hit by the "extremely serious and
OL,22,Funprecedented" attack.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
