OL,3,AFridges in French supermarkets hit by
OL,4,Acyber attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 100 of the chain's
OL,7,Fsupermarkets were targeted, while 180
OL,8,Fstores from Intermarche and its Netto
OL,9,Fbrand were affected, with a spokesman
OL,10,Fsaying that another 100 shops were
OL,11,Furgently disconnected from the internet
OL,12,Fto prevent the same thing happening to
OL,13,Fthem.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
